  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-picnic-vote-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7369663220e8d98e2130a3792e72f11e0fba44aa0161d849a8eb59abf810a380",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78852668d723ab1bd74475ca7a899d9ba281e3d0f5308a5ac8f6faee80677f21",
      "text": "野餐玩什么？",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a1fc76bb1fed24f70192d5deda99bf92035fc87b69cb2b8969dee5b3c5f97920",
      "text": "六个好朋友在桃子草坡上野餐。\n午饭吃得精光。\n悟空说：“该玩游戏啦！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c43f99d5b75c96fe6da4f55e4921fc78c9d11d3760493ba513c6ca70c7e066b5",
      "text": "铁扇公主带了风筝，\n哪吒带了泡泡水，\n玉兔带了蜡笔。\n三个好选择！先玩哪个呢？\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e725f099e3e94807107fe9a65b3040ed83f79d61abbfc4b420a86fbbcaff8497",
      "text": "“放风筝！”“吹泡泡！”“画画！”\n大家七嘴八舌，一起嚷嚷。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4543de7f40eadb61bc2b926fa01b2c353190b842507811c89311b42620178f59",
      "text": "悟空喊得最响：\n“风筝！风筝！风筝！”\n“谁的声音大，就听谁的！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "847b590ec74c76a294c4a3c0ba154da352801d3dcd55a9ee6cda919051f74e3f",
      "text": "结果大家喊得更响了。\n这下谁也听不见谁！\n八戒赶紧捂住耳朵。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "831c3a142c64c1b9708466f83a16d72dd544f465714d0814ea4e0dea47eda8df",
      "text": "玉兔拿出一张纸，\n画了一张分成三列的图表。\n每一列是一个选择。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4b90e436c4144ea310f4553fbc223a5d2cc8225db7aaa738b26e356c6418b591",
      "text": "她给每人发一张星星贴纸。\n玉兔说：“一人一张贴纸，\n这就是你的一票。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dc84c11bf814ce787c486a66e958f398d704a24886386b092f4765eb093be5a0",
      "text": "玉兔说：“贴纸从最下面贴起，\n中间不留空。”\n悟空把贴纸贴在风筝那一列。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9c2f952363187cd2cc20e6e421b7af5ab70bc81d4c7cc70b3168a99618038193",
      "text": "敖丙也选了风筝。\n八戒选了泡泡：\n“我最爱戳泡泡啦！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "37accf67297250840a4a976c1480762aba86bc265277417ccd63f72edf323a9e",
      "text": "哪吒也选了泡泡。\n铁扇公主选了风筝：\n“这个坡上的风最好啦！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "96770bdf21d77f6bbcebd8a8d37226d9e496bc0d658d97103d6ed32df697ce7f",
      "text": "玉兔把贴纸贴在画画那一列。\n六个朋友，六张贴纸，\n大家都投好票了！\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a26dc4303138ea50e8fe70e852ca879d11b29eeed18fd149d8a2a10d08f28ba8",
      "text": "风筝三票，\n泡泡两票，\n画画一票。\n哪一列最高，哪一个的票\n就最多！\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "342524160546791e9e7487792a27734ac9ec0f2d8feed2865d780671d21bd737",
      "text": "图表上看得清清楚楚：\n风筝的票最多，\n泡泡和画画少一些。\n铁扇公主说：“先放风筝，\n再吹泡泡、画画！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7afe680e860a6faea4c18eb7ec5dfe241d14351d07f5fe13ec3f6d5f60e3b8b1",
      "text": "八戒问：“能不能加第四列？\n‘再吃一回点心’！”\n大家都笑了。\n玉兔把它记在新的一页上，下次\n野餐用。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "50c35a0d9bdb4e00706448a8204dc280e1355eea09c8d7c1e4e58c57fa422968",
      "text": "风筝飞呀飞，飞上了天！\n接着大家吹泡泡，\n最后玉兔给每个人画了像。\n谁也不用扯着嗓子喊啦。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
